{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_title", "source_sha256": "17db54dbff324cb6635c7b0ff6271d59379e84c921e58bf0a52460f31e24fad8", "ja": "お土産は、思い出話と共に", "zh": "伴手礼与回忆一同分享", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "be7863420b1403969f20be5879698d36b8ad1b714fcd0c3733394899b3bcb976", "ja": "ツアーを終え、劇場へ戻る前にお土産を選ぶ\nアイドル達だったが、突然、亜美が遊園地に\n行きたいと言い出す。昴、志保、エミリーも\n亜美に同意、全員で土産話になる思い出を\n作ることにする。", "zh": "结束巡演后，偶像们在返回剧场前挑选伴手礼，\n这时亚美突然说想去游乐园。昴、志保和艾米莉也\n表示赞同，于是大家决定一起创造值得日后津津乐道的\n美好回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "63ee3972c1e513d02c774f3884c7637abba6f050d66e493fd25098d09ee87d00", "ja": "（集大成ライブを終え、劇場へ戻る移動日。\n最後に大阪駅周辺でゆっくりお土産選びを……）", "zh": "（结束了集大成演唱会，今天是回剧场的移动日。\n最后就在大阪站附近悠闲地挑选纪念品吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "052f78a59853465aef9400d604b1e6e28ea7c45b386a2b306f69805b83501c38", "ja": "行きたい行きたい行きたい！　亜美、大阪のめーっちゃ\nおっきい遊園地に行って、遊びまくりたい～っ！！！", "zh": "想去想去想去！亚美想去大阪那座超～大的游乐园，痛痛快快地玩个够～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cbc105f7f1df2ed1ddcfe0ae3fad5761d23068844e5aa815fedb4fe4121ebd68", "ja": "剛速球のワガママが来たな……でも、今から\n遊園地に行ってたら、お土産を選ぶ時間が……。", "zh": "这任性的直球来得真猛啊……不过，现在要是去游乐园的话，挑选伴手礼的时间就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "10d0b9106270ecfde8f491307c0c72e4c97bf67c0213c6975dd3986b5cbace90", "ja": "お土産かぁ。オレ、百合子たちになに買っていくか\nまだ決まってないんだよな～。", "zh": "伴手礼啊。我还没决定要给百合子她们买什么呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "a59847db22d1c63e6290953436a4701c21777c3f8ab2901331eac2e66e66bef6", "ja": "私も、まだ悩んでいて。歌織さん、まつりさん、\n琴葉さん……みんな年上で、趣味も違うし。", "zh": "我也还在苦恼。歌织姐、茉莉姐、琴叶姐……大家都比我年长，兴趣也各不相同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "c70a539a85f33d2ce4e7dadb713bcf18d32442120d1eb66452de29f2887da156", "ja": "私も朋花さんに、和の小物をなにかと思うのですが。\n中途半端な物をお渡しするわけには……！", "zh": "我也想送朋花小姐一些日式小物，可是……不能送太过随便的东西给她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "38dc78093db6dc89f37082b471c8f771076f66797b1de853ba329982157c8378", "ja": "遊園地～！！　せっかくみんなで大阪にいるんだし、\n亜美、もっと遊びたいよ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "游乐园——！！难得大家都在大阪，亚美还想再多玩一会儿，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "97550373885dcb3fc33dd4c20a23b7ee61a030afc1b8df87da9dac2af14b7524", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん。\nせっかくだし、遊園地……行ってみませんか？", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。\n难得有这个机会，要不要去游乐园看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "481763039950b8b7c818ab891bfb6c9f7f874a1b5f4eb9d0addf03b6d05bbf8d", "ja": "えっ。でも……。", "zh": "诶。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "a8d55000f0b25acb290d7e9587cda3fe6a26ce2fcaef9eb074d75b03a2c942a1", "ja": "オレも、ちょっとアリかなって。今回のメンバーで\nもっと思い出作りたいのはホントだし……。", "zh": "我也觉得，好像也不是不行。毕竟我是真的想和这次的成员们一起创造更多回忆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "1ef1095babaeb3c9b7d5783c4f31f668a6aa91fa385de1194aae51969628cd68", "ja": "それに、みんなで遊んだら、絶対面白いことが\n起きそうだなって！　土産話ってやつになるだろ？", "zh": "而且，要是大家一起去玩，感觉肯定会发生什么有趣的事！到时候不就能当成值得一说的经历了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "0cae60f9dc468c3f3a1a369de1c04a13d40f15fd4e67228b39c59a7b7b139a28", "ja": "思い出が、お土産話に……ふふっ、素敵ですね♪\nでしたら私も、ぜひご一緒したいです！", "zh": "回忆会变成带回去分享的趣事……呵呵，真棒呢♪\n既然这样，我也很想和大家一起去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1120d89bcca45e3b1da74654b1f10e751849b0fd2974d8562b5e61337ea8728d", "ja": "仕方ないな……それじゃ、乗るものは厳選するとして。\n……お土産は、遊園地で買おうか。", "zh": "真拿你们没办法……那就挑着项目玩吧。……伴手礼就在游乐园买吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "2b8c6018a84999187cada1ef7372245e67b27feacdb54d15d3558050ec770727", "ja": "さっすが兄ちゃん、話がわかるね♪　それじゃ皆の者、\n急ぐのじゃ～！　遊園地が、亜美たちを待ってるよ！", "zh": "不愧是哥哥，真懂我♪ 那么各位——赶紧的～！游乐园还等着我们亚美呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_epi02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "549a02f946067b1ff2f22c9514948480759bb5fd700ee4a30c584ce1096ca16d", "ja": "（関西のみんなを楽しませてくれたアイドル達に、\n感謝の意味をこめて……最後の大サービスといくか！）", "zh": "（为了感谢让关西的大家都开心的偶像们……就来个最后的大放送吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
